# nearby.suite — nearby on a simulated LAN, A to Z in one world: an unowned
# node listed and adopted by its nearby alias, two nodes of one User meeting in
# stealth, a Silent node sending nothing, and a sibling relinked the moment it
# is heard again.
#
# Every test runs VM operations: nearby needs a LAN, and a local world has
# none (ether skips loopback). Each continues the one before, so the four are
# one chain in one simulation, and a failure skips the tests after it. The
# order puts the long outage last.
nearby-adopt
nearby-stealth-meet
nearby-silent
nearby-relink
